{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>When a soul sins.</b> To commit unwittingly one of the negative commandments upon which is karet or lashes. And the word נפש is a general inclusive term, for Israel and for the ger, as it is written. And afterward he specified, beginning with the high priest — he is the anointed priest."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:32.687275547Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}